#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0514 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "Authority: ADaM Conformance Rules v5.0 CR514 ('A variable ending in STMF must contain Start Time Imputation Flag in the label'). Lowercase names on the rule's two name tests: astmf ends in STMF and its label 'Start Time Flag' has no Imputation-Flag suffix -> one violation, reported as astmf. trtstmf and tr01stmf carry the same non-conforming label but resolve, ignoring letter case (CIT 1), to the ADSL literal TRTSTMF and the ADSL template TRxxSTMF (D9, PLAN-library-template-label-resolution), so they are no stem case - label_template(\"LIBRARY\", stem=\"*STMF\") answers a missing for them (R2-3) - and the rule does not judge them."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *STMF name=*STMF label="{Start Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *TMF name=*TMF label="{Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRTSTMF name=TRTSTMF label="Time of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRxxSTMF name=TRxxSTMF label="Time 1st Exposure Period xx Imput. Flag"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_label="Start Time Flag" variable_name=astmf
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col studyid type=Char
col usubjid type=Char
col paramcd type=Char
col astmf type=Char label="Start Time Flag"
col trtstmf type=Char label="Start Time Flag"
col tr01stmf type=Char label="Start Time Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x
---
